    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastbane is developed to offer you a different kind of online horror experience. Even while communicating with your friends using 3D voice, you must stay quiet. Every step you take can be heard by the creatures around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional horror games, this 1-4 player game requires you to work with your teammates to find all possible items on the map, complete objectives, and execute your escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics, minimal user interface, and a gloomy atmosphere will deliver a truly immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastbane is developed to offer you a different kind of online horror experience. Even while communicating with your friends using 3D voice, you must stay quiet. Every step you take can be heard by the creatures around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/5c2bffbe6d17df14991ee2cf60f7ab93.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional horror games, this 1-4 player game requires you to work with your teammates to find all possible items on the map, complete objectives, and execute your escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/4036c79cf86e446a2cba9dd99df2ad6a.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics, minimal user interface, and a gloomy atmosphere will deliver a truly immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.poster.avif?t=1752848258\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.webm?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/c8033f62f6de909fbc4ce04b9eec6980.mp4?t=1752848258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
